'' A GENERIC'S INSTANCE in the editor scan. A variable's type text names it as the source
'' does -- not by its cache key, 'map<15,8>', which no record had -- and the instance is
'' a record of that name, its members' types substituted, flagged GENERIC (&h800) so the
'' editor never lists it. Wherever it lives: std's Map is declared in an imported
'' module's interface namespace, Box in the root's own scope.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan tests/api/src/scangeneric.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: var b as Box( of Box( of long ) )  @0:12:12  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: var m as Map( of string, long )  @0:13:12  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: type Box( of Box( of long ) )  @0:12:17  parent=-1  flags=&h800
'' EXPECT-OUT: field v as Box( of long )  @0:4:5  parent=
'' EXPECT-OUT: function Get as Box( of long )  @0:8:22  parent=
'' EXPECT-OUT: type Map( of string, long )  @0:13:
'' EXPECT-OUT: function [] as long  @
'' EXPECT-NOT: box<
'' EXPECT-NOT: map<
